<title>CANADA: National Trustco not open to competing bids.</title>
<headline>National Trustco not open to competing bids.</headline>
<dateline>TORONTO 1997-06-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>National Trustco Inc said on Tuesday it was not open to competing bids against a C$1.25 billion offer for the company today by Bank of Nova Scotia .</p>
<p>&quot;I am not open to competing bids,&quot; said National Trustco chairman Hal Jackman.</p>
<p>He said that closing off other bids was part of the deal that allowed Scotiabank to lock up 47 percent of National Trustco's outstanding common shares in exchange for extending its cash and stock offer to other shareholders.</p>
<p>((Reuters Toronto Bureau 416 941-8100))</p>
